<!doctype html>
<meta charset="utf8">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="./spec.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/highlight.js/8.4/styles/github.min.css">
<script src="./spec.js"></script>
<pre class="metadata">
title: Object.pick and Object.omit
stage: 1
contributors: Aleen, Hemanth HM, Jordan Harband, J.S. Choi
</pre>

<emu-clause id="sec-properties-of-the-object-constructor">
  <h1>Properties of the Object Constructor</h1>

  <emu-clause id="sec-object.pick">
    <h1>Object.pick ( _O_, _predicateOrKeys_ )</h1>
    <p>When the `Object.pick` function is called with arguments _O_ and _predicateOrKeys_, the following steps are taken:</p>
    <emu-alg>
      1. Let _obj_ be ? ToObject(_O_).
      1. Let _result_ be OrdinaryObjectCreate(%Object.prototype%).
      1. If _predicateOrKeys_ is *undefined*, return _result_.
      1. If IsCallable(_predicateOrKeys_) is *true*, then
        1. Let _keys_ be ? _obj_.[[OwnPropertyKeys]]().
        1. For each element _key_ of _keys_, do
          1. Let _desc_ be ? _obj_.[[GetOwnProperty]](_key_).
          1. If _desc_ is not *undefined* and _desc_.[[Enumerable]] is *true*, then
            1. Let _value_ be ? Get(_obj_, _key_).
            1. Let _selected_ be ToBoolean(? Call(_predicateOrKeys_, *undefined*, « _value_, _key_, _obj_ »)).
            1. If _selected_ is *true*, then
              1. Perform ! CreateDataPropertyOrThrow(_result_, _key_, _value_).
        1. Return _result_.
      1. Let _iteratorRecord_ be ? GetIterator(_predicateOrKeys_, ~sync~).
      1. Let _keysList_ be a new empty List.
      1. Let _next_ be *true*.
      1. Repeat, while _next_ is not *false*,
        1. Let _next_ be ? IteratorStep(_iteratorRecord_).
        1. If _next_ is not *false*, then
          1. Let _nextValue_ be ? IteratorValue(_next_).
          1. Let _propKey_ be ? ToPropertyKey(_nextValue_).
          1. Append _propKey_ to _keysList_.
      1. For each element _key_ of _keysList_, do
        1. Let _has_ be ? HasProperty(_obj_, _key_).
        1. If _has_ is *true*, then
          1. Let _value_ be ? Get(_obj_, _key_).
          1. Perform ! CreateDataPropertyOrThrow(_result_, _key_, _value_).
      1. Return _result_.
    </emu-alg>
  </emu-clause>

  <emu-clause id="sec-object.omit">
    <h1>Object.omit ( _O_, _predicateOrKeys_ )</h1>
    <p>When the `Object.omit` function is called with arguments _O_ and _predicateOrKeys_, the following steps are taken:</p>
    <emu-alg>
      1. Let _obj_ be ? ToObject(_O_).
      1. Let _result_ be OrdinaryObjectCreate(%Object.prototype%).
      1. If _predicateOrKeys_ is *undefined*, then
        1. Let _keys_ be ? _obj_.[[OwnPropertyKeys]]().
        1. For each element _key_ of _keys_, do
          1. Let _desc_ be ? _obj_.[[GetOwnProperty]](_key_).
          1. If _desc_ is not *undefined* and _desc_.[[Enumerable]] is *true*, then
            1. Let _value_ be ? Get(_obj_, _key_).
            1. Perform ! CreateDataPropertyOrThrow(_result_, _key_, _value_).
        1. Return _result_.
      1. If IsCallable(_predicateOrKeys_) is *true*, then
        1. Let _keys_ be ? _obj_.[[OwnPropertyKeys]]().
        1. For each element _key_ of _keys_, do
          1. Let _desc_ be ? _obj_.[[GetOwnProperty]](_key_).
          1. If _desc_ is not *undefined* and _desc_.[[Enumerable]] is *true*, then
            1. Let _value_ be ? Get(_obj_, _key_).
            1. Let _excluded_ be ToBoolean(? Call(_predicateOrKeys_, *undefined*, « _value_, _key_, _obj_ »)).
            1. If _excluded_ is *false*, then
              1. Perform ! CreateDataPropertyOrThrow(_result_, _key_, _value_).
        1. Return _result_.
      1. Let _iteratorRecord_ be ? GetIterator(_predicateOrKeys_, ~sync~).
      1. Let _omittedKeys_ be a new empty List.
      1. Let _next_ be *true*.
      1. Repeat, while _next_ is not *false*,
        1. Let _next_ be ? IteratorStep(_iteratorRecord_).
        1. If _next_ is not *false*, then
          1. Let _nextValue_ be ? IteratorValue(_next_).
          1. Let _propKey_ be ? ToPropertyKey(_nextValue_).
          1. Append _propKey_ to _omittedKeys_.
      1. Let _keys_ be ? _obj_.[[OwnPropertyKeys]]().
      1. For each element _key_ of _keys_, do
        1. Let _desc_ be ? _obj_.[[GetOwnProperty]](_key_).
        1. If _desc_ is not *undefined* and _desc_.[[Enumerable]] is *true*, then
          1. If _omittedKeys_ does not contain _key_, then
            1. Let _value_ be ? Get(_obj_, _key_).
            1. Perform ! CreateDataPropertyOrThrow(_result_, _key_, _value_).
      1. Return _result_.
    </emu-alg>
  </emu-clause>
</emu-clause>
